# S000805 candidate summary

Destination added: `src/arch/x86/include/uapi/asm/vmx.rs`.

The file contains the required immutable provenance for
`arch/x86/include/uapi/asm/vmx.h` at Linux revision
`425f94c2954b1fe80ebdbf9b29854e89750355df`, then:

- 72 public constants preserving all direct source macro names and values;
- `VMX_EXIT_REASONS`, an ordered 65-element `(i32, &str)` mapping matching the
  source initializer-list macro exactly;
- `VMX_EXIT_REASON_FLAGS`, its ordered one-element `(u32, &str)` mapping.

Focused representation changes: C decimal integer macros are explicit `i32`
constants; C hexadecimal flag macros are explicit `u32` constants; C
initializer-list macros are immutable Rust arrays because Rust has no
preprocessor initializer-list equivalent.  No operational behavior, control
flow, ABI-bearing type, or conditional compilation exists in this source.
